  "description": "The Albatross is our newest titanium model - our first bike using the 32\" wheel size. It draws upon and elevates all we have learned in developing big wheeled bikes over the past two decades - using these incredible wheels and tyres to create a bike which carries speed and handles like no other.\n\nThese frames are made to order with an 8-10 week lead time.\n\nBigger wheels means bigger momentum. More grip, more speed and better rollover.\n\nDesigned as an all-round great riding cross-country, bikepacking, rigid specific MTB - the type of thing Singular does best.\n\nJust like our venerable 29\" wheeled Swift, we designed this with either a flat bar or drops in mind. build it to your taste!",
